---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import logo from "../assets/padyna-official-logo.ico";
---

<section>
  <div
    class="mx-auto max-w-7xl border-y border-neutral-200 px-10 py-18 sm:font-light"
  >
    <div class="body-text text-left sm:text-2xl">
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-balance">
        Your customers want to help themselves, but <b
          >your help center is out-of-date or doesn't exist.</b
        > Outdated articles frustrate them, flood your inbox, and rack up costs.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed"></p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex items-start gap-2 sm:items-center">
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          <Image
            src={logo}
            alt="Padyna logo"
            class="h-8 w-auto"
            width={24}
            height={24}
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            class="inline rotate-3 rounded-lg shadow-sm sm:-mt-1.5 sm:mr-2"
            style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"
          /><b>Ferndesk</b> is the first help center that helps you <b
            >spend less time on docs and support</b
          >, and <b>more time growing your business.</b>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
